{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>For she sinks down</b> — the woman herself sinks down toward death, which is her house, and it stands and does not go out, as many have supposed." "<b>Rephaim</b> — the dead, from the language of the weak, because their strength has failed, as in the phrase 'and the mighty man dies and becomes weak.'"], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:51.389186840Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}